---
root Bench
  net gnd (ground)
  net input
  net output
  net vcc
  Resistor r_bottom a→output b→gnd value=1 kΩ
  Resistor r_in a→input b→gnd value=knob r_in.value
  Resistor r_top a→vcc b→output value=1 kΩ
  knob r_in.value Statistical 10 kΩ ± 1%
  knob vcc.v Range 5 V ± 5%
  knob vcc.z Range 250 mΩ (0 Ω..=500 mΩ)
  knob output.r Range 10 kΩ ± 10%
  knob temp Range 315.65 K (42.5 °C) (233.15 K..=398.15 K)
  setup Wide
    vcc: Supply v=knob vcc.v z=knob vcc.z
    input: Signal v=0 V z=50 Ω
    output: Load r=knob output.r c=10 pF
    temp=knob temp
  checkable specs: out
root Left
  net gnd (ground)
  net vcc
  Resistor r a→vcc b→gnd value=1 kΩ
  knob ambient Range 298.15 K (25 °C) (263.15 K..=333.15 K)
  setup Hot
    vcc: Supply v=3.3 V
    temp=knob ambient
root Point
  net gnd (ground)
  net vcc
  Resistor r a→vcc b→gnd value=1 kΩ
  setup Room
